Get the "hell" out of there (pun slightly intended) and get out of
gehennom.  I hope you have teleport control or this may be harder.
Find something to eat (either a corpse or a stash) until you're not
hungry, then try praying -- your god may uncurse everything you have,
or at least your shield or weapon so you can get to your BOH.  Do *NOT*
pray in Gehennom unless you enjoy the wrath of angry gods and want to
attract Moloch's attention too.

